  plot_layout(guides = 'collect') + 
  plot_annotation(
    title = "Penguin Plot",
    tag_levels = "A"
  ) 
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](slides06_files/figure-revealjs/unnamed-chunk-7-1.png){fig-align='center' width=768}
