## Text size and contrast

-   Make text big enough to read from the back of the room, and when zoomed in
-   Contrast between text and background: at least **4.5:1** (WCAG AA). Large text and graphical elements: at least **3:1**
-   Light gray on white is the usual culprit
-   Check yours: [WebAIM Contrast Checker](https://webaim.org/resources/contrastchecker/) or `colorspace::contrast_ratio()`

