## Plain-language titles and labels

-   Say what the graph shows. A title can state the takeaway
-   Write axis and legend labels for people, not code: "Median hourly wage (US dollars)", not `hourly_wage_median`
-   Include units, and spell out abbreviations
-   Good labels are what your alt text and surrounding text build on

